sequenceDiagram
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant O as order-db
    participant P as payment-db
    participant I as inventory-db

    S->>O: log STARTED order_created
    S->>O: create order
    S->>O: log DONE order_created
    S->>P: charge payment
    S->>O: log DONE payment_charged
    S->>I: reserve stock
    S->>O: log DONE stock_reserved
    S->>O: confirm order
    S->>O: log DONE order_confirmed
